{
  "name": "RAG Chatbot — Ingestion + Query (v4.7.2 — Gruppe 1, Case 1)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "##  INGESTION — Dokumente in die Vektor-DB\n\n**Trigger:** Manuell (einmalig zum Befüllen / bei Doc-Updates)\n\n**Ablauf:**\n\n1. **Read Files** — liest die HR-Markdown-Docs vom Dateisystem\n2. **Text Splitter** — Recursive Character, 500 Zeichen, Overlap 50\n3. **Embeddings** — OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small`\n4. **Supabase Insert** — pgvector, Tabelle `documents`\n\n**Quelle:** `company-docs/hr-set-a/**/*.md`",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1664,
        "color": "#0773C5"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -384,
        0
      ],
      "id": "c31ab5ef-c4cd-4174-bb19-eae1960be153",
